    <style>
        table { border-collapse: collapse; font-family: '맑은 고딕', sans-serif; }
        th { background-color: #4ECDC4; color: white; font-weight: bold; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #2C3E50; text-align: center; }
        td { padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #D9D9D9; font-size: 13px; }
        .center { text-align: center; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>번호</th><th>영어 단어 (Word)</th><th>한글 발음 (Phonics)</th><th>한국어 뜻 (Meaning)</th><th>주제 (Category)</th><th>영어 예문 (Example EN)</th><th>한국어 해석 (Example KO)</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">1</td>
                    <td><b>Apple</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[애플]</td>
                    <td>사과</td>
                    <td class="center">과일/음식 🍎</td>
                    <td>I eat an apple.</td>
                    <td>나는 사과를 먹어요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">2</td>
                    <td><b>Banana</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[버내너]</td>
                    <td>바나나</td>
                    <td class="center">과일/음식 🍎</td>
                    <td>Monkeys like bananas.</td>
                    <td>원숭이는 바나나를 좋아해요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">3</td>
                    <td><b>Milk</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[밀크]</td>
                    <td>우유</td>
                    <td class="center">과일/음식 🍎</td>
                    <td>Drink warm milk.</td>
                    <td>따뜻한 우유를 마셔요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">4</td>
                    <td><b>Water</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[워터]</td>
                    <td>물</td>
                    <td class="center">과일/음식 🍎</td>
                    <td>I drink water.</td>
                    <td>나는 물을 마셔요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">5</td>
                    <td><b>Bread</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[브레드]</td>
                    <td>빵</td>
                    <td class="center">과일/음식 🍎</td>
                    <td>I eat bread for breakfast.</td>
                    <td>나는 아침으로 빵을 먹어요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">6</td>
                    <td><b>Egg</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[에그]</td>
                    <td>계란/달걀</td>
                    <td class="center">과일/음식 🍎</td>
                    <td>I like fried eggs.</td>
                    <td>나는 계란 프라이를 좋아해요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">7</td>
                    <td><b>Juice</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[주스]</td>
                    <td>주스</td>
                    <td class="center">과일/음식 🍎</td>
                    <td>Orange juice is sweet.</td>
                    <td>오렌지 주스는 달콤해요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">8</td>
                    <td><b>Rice</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[라이스]</td>
                    <td>밥/쌀</td>
                    <td class="center">과일/음식 🍎</td>
                    <td>We eat rice every day.</td>
                    <td>우리는 매일 밥을 먹어요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">9</td>
                    <td><b>Cake</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[케이크]</td>
                    <td>케이크</td>
                    <td class="center">과일/음식 🍎</td>
                    <td>Happy birthday cake!</td>
                    <td>생일 축하 케이크!</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">10</td>
                    <td><b>Candy</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[캔디]</td>
                    <td>사탕</td>
                    <td class="center">과일/음식 🍎</td>
                    <td>Sweet candy is yummy.</td>
                    <td>달콤한 사탕은 맛있어요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">11</td>
                    <td><b>Orange</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[오렌지]</td>
                    <td>오렌지</td>
                    <td class="center">과일/음식 🍎</td>
                    <td>The orange is juicy.</td>
                    <td>오렌지가 즙이 많아요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">12</td>
                    <td><b>Grape</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[그레이프]</td>
                    <td>포도</td>
                    <td class="center">과일/음식 🍎</td>
                    <td>Purple grapes are sweet.</td>
                    <td>보라색 포도는 달콤해요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">13</td>
                    <td><b>Strawberry</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[스트로베리]</td>
                    <td>딸기</td>
                    <td class="center">과일/음식 🍎</td>
                    <td>Red strawberries are fresh.</td>
                    <td>빨간 딸기가 신선해요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">14</td>
                    <td><b>Peach</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[피치]</td>
                    <td>복숭아</td>
                    <td class="center">과일/음식 🍎</td>
                    <td>Pink peach is soft.</td>
                    <td>분홍 복숭아는 부드러워요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">15</td>
                    <td><b>Watermelon</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[워터멜론]</td>
                    <td>수박</td>
                    <td class="center">과일/음식 🍎</td>
                    <td>Watermelon is good in summer.</td>
                    <td>수박은 여름에 좋아요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">16</td>
                    <td><b>Pizza</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[피자]</td>
                    <td>피자</td>
                    <td class="center">과일/음식 🍎</td>
                    <td>Let's eat cheese pizza.</td>
                    <td>치즈 피자를 먹어요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">17</td>
                    <td><b>Hamburger</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[햄버거]</td>
                    <td>햄버거</td>
                    <td class="center">과일/음식 🍎</td>
                    <td>I like big hamburgers.</td>
                    <td>나는 큰 햄버거를 좋아해요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">18</td>
                    <td><b>Noodle</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[누들]</td>
                    <td>국수/면</td>
                    <td class="center">과일/음식 🍎</td>
                    <td>Hot noodles are delicious.</td>
                    <td>따뜻한 국수는 맛있어요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">19</td>
                    <td><b>Meat</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[미트]</td>
                    <td>고기</td>
                    <td class="center">과일/음식 🍎</td>
                    <td>Cook the fresh meat.</td>
                    <td>신선한 고기를 요리해요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">20</td>
                    <td><b>Fish</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[피쉬]</td>
                    <td>생선/물고기</td>
                    <td class="center">과일/음식 🍎</td>
                    <td>Fresh fish is good.</td>
                    <td>신선한 생선이 좋아요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">21</td>
                    <td><b>Soup</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[수프]</td>
                    <td>스프/국</td>
                    <td class="center">과일/음식 🍎</td>
                    <td>Warm soup is nice.</td>
                    <td>따뜻한 스프가 좋아요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">22</td>
                    <td><b>Salad</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[샐러드]</td>
                    <td>샐러드</td>
                    <td class="center">과일/음식 🍎</td>
                    <td>Eat healthy salad.</td>
                    <td>건강한 샐러드를 먹어요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">23</td>
                    <td><b>Cheese</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[치즈]</td>
                    <td>치즈</td>
                    <td class="center">과일/음식 🍎</td>
                    <td>Yellow cheese is savory.</td>
                    <td>노란 치즈는 고소해요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">24</td>
                    <td><b>Butter</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[버터]</td>
                    <td>버터</td>
                    <td class="center">과일/음식 🍎</td>
                    <td>Spread butter on bread.</td>
                    <td>빵에 버터를 바르세요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">25</td>
                    <td><b>Cookie</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[쿠키]</td>
                    <td>쿠키/과자</td>
                    <td class="center">과일/음식 🍎</td>
                    <td>Bake sweet cookies.</td>
                    <td>달콤한 쿠키를 구워요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">26</td>
                    <td><b>Dog</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[독]</td>
                    <td>개/강아지</td>
                    <td class="center">동물 & 곤충 🐶</td>
                    <td>My dog wags its tail.</td>
                    <td>내 강아지가 꼬리를 쳐요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">27</td>
                    <td><b>Cat</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[캣]</td>
                    <td>고양이</td>
                    <td class="center">동물 & 곤충 🐶</td>
                    <td>The cat sleeps on the bed.</td>
                    <td>고양이가 침대에서 자요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">28</td>
                    <td><b>Bird</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[버드]</td>
                    <td>새</td>
                    <td class="center">동물 & 곤충 🐶</td>
                    <td>The bird sings softly.</td>
                    <td>새가 부드럽게 노래해요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">29</td>
                    <td><b>Duck</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[덕]</td>
                    <td>오리</td>
                    <td class="center">동물 & 곤충 🐶</td>
                    <td>Ducks swim well.</td>
                    <td>오리는 수영을 잘해요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">30</td>
                    <td><b>Pig</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[피그]</td>
                    <td>돼지</td>
                    <td class="center">동물 & 곤충 🐶</td>
                    <td>Pigs are cute.</td>
                    <td>돼지는 귀여워요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">31</td>
                    <td><b>Bear</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[베어]</td>
                    <td>곰</td>
                    <td class="center">동물 & 곤충 🐶</td>
                    <td>Bears love honey.</td>
                    <td>곰은 꿀을 좋아해요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">32</td>
                    <td><b>Rabbit</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[래빗]</td>
                    <td>토끼</td>
                    <td class="center">동물 & 곤충 🐶</td>
                    <td>Rabbits jump high.</td>
                    <td>토끼는 높이 뛰어올라요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">33</td>
                    <td><b>Lion</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[라이언]</td>
                    <td>사자</td>
                    <td class="center">동물 & 곤충 🐶</td>
                    <td>Lions are strong.</td>
                    <td>사자는 힘이 세요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">34</td>
                    <td><b>Tiger</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[타이거]</td>
                    <td>호랑이</td>
                    <td class="center">동물 & 곤충 🐶</td>
                    <td>Tigers have stripes.</td>
                    <td>호랑이는 줄무늬가 있어요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">35</td>
                    <td><b>Elephant</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[엘리펀트]</td>
                    <td>코끼리</td>
                    <td class="center">동물 & 곤충 🐶</td>
                    <td>Elephants have long trunks.</td>
                    <td>코끼리는 긴 코를 가지고 있어요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">36</td>
                    <td><b>Giraffe</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[지래프]</td>
                    <td>기린</td>
                    <td class="center">동물 & 곤충 🐶</td>
                    <td>Giraffes are tall.</td>
                    <td>기린은 키가 크요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">37</td>
                    <td><b>Monkey</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[멍키]</td>
                    <td>원숭이</td>
                    <td class="center">동물 & 곤충 🐶</td>
                    <td>Monkeys climb trees.</td>
                    <td>원숭이는 나무를 타요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">38</td>
                    <td><b>Horse</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[호스]</td>
                    <td>말</td>
                    <td class="center">동물 & 곤충 🐶</td>
                    <td>The horse runs fast.</td>
                    <td>말이 빠르게 달려요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">39</td>
                    <td><b>Cow</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[카우]</td>
                    <td>소</td>
                    <td class="center">동물 & 곤충 🐶</td>
                    <td>Cows give us milk.</td>
                    <td>소는 우리에게 우유를 줘요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">40</td>
                    <td><b>Sheep</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[쉽]</td>
                    <td>양</td>
                    <td class="center">동물 & 곤충 🐶</td>
                    <td>Sheep have white wool.</td>
                    <td>양은 하얀 털을 갖고 있어요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">41</td>
                    <td><b>Frog</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[프로그]</td>
                    <td>개구리</td>
                    <td class="center">동물 & 곤충 🐶</td>
                    <td>Green frog jumps.</td>
                    <td>초록 개구리가 뛰어요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">42</td>
                    <td><b>Butterfly</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[버터플라이]</td>
                    <td>나비</td>
                    <td class="center">동물 & 곤충 🐶</td>
                    <td>The butterfly flies gently.</td>
                    <td>나비가 부드럽게 날아요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">43</td>
                    <td><b>Ant</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[앤트]</td>
                    <td>개미</td>
                    <td class="center">동물 & 곤충 🐶</td>
                    <td>Ants work hard.</td>
                    <td>개미는 열심히 일해요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">44</td>
                    <td><b>Bee</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[비]</td>
                    <td>꿀벌</td>
                    <td class="center">동물 & 곤충 🐶</td>
                    <td>Bees make sweet honey.</td>
                    <td>벌들은 달콤한 꿀을 만들어요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">45</td>
                    <td><b>Whale</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[웨일]</td>
                    <td>고래</td>
                    <td class="center">동물 & 곤충 🐶</td>
                    <td>Big whale swims in the ocean.</td>
                    <td>큰 고래가 바다에서 헤엄쳐요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">46</td>
                    <td><b>Dolphin</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[돌핀]</td>
                    <td>돌고래</td>
                    <td class="center">동물 & 곤충 🐶</td>
                    <td>Dolphins are smart.</td>
                    <td>돌고래는 똑똑해요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">47</td>
                    <td><b>Shark</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[샤크]</td>
                    <td>상어</td>
                    <td class="center">동물 & 곤충 🐶</td>
                    <td>Sharks swim fast.</td>
                    <td>상어는 빠르게 수영해요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">48</td>
                    <td><b>Snake</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[스네이크]</td>
                    <td>뱀</td>
                    <td class="center">동물 & 곤충 🐶</td>
                    <td>The snake moves quietly.</td>
                    <td>뱀이 조용히 움직여요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">49</td>
                    <td><b>Turtle</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[터틀]</td>
                    <td>거북이</td>
                    <td class="center">동물 & 곤충 🐶</td>
                    <td>Turtles walk slowly.</td>
                    <td>거북이는 천천히 걸어가요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">50</td>
                    <td><b>Fox</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[폭스]</td>
                    <td>여우</td>
                    <td class="center">동물 & 곤충 🐶</td>
                    <td>The fox is clever.</td>
                    <td>여우는 영리해요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">51</td>
                    <td><b>Father</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[파더]</td>
                    <td>아버지/아빠</td>
                    <td class="center">가족 & 학교/사람 👨‍👩‍👧‍👦</td>
                    <td>My father is kind.</td>
                    <td>우리 아버지는 친절해요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">52</td>
                    <td><b>Mother</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[마더]</td>
                    <td>어머니/엄마</td>
                    <td class="center">가족 & 학교/사람 👨‍👩‍👧‍👦</td>
                    <td>I love my mother.</td>
                    <td>나는 엄마를 사랑해요.</td>
                </tr>
            
                <tr>
                    <td class="center">53</td>
                    <td><b>Brother</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[브라더]</td>
                    <td>남동생/형/오빠</td>
